<h1>Webhooks endpoint <span class='chip chip--primary'>v2</span> <span class='chip chip--success'>Stable</span></h1>
<p>Subscribe to platform lifecycle events — such as <code>pipeline.completed</code> or <code>connector.error</code> — as outbound HTTP requests to a URL you control. This is the v2 replacement for v1's polling-only status checks; see the <a href="/versions/migration-guide-v1-to-v2">Migration guide</a> if you're moving off v1.</p>

